  itemDesc: {
    // -- Magic Weapons --
    "Spear of Antarhak":`Spear/light lance. For every unsaved Wound inflicted, the wielder regains a single Wound lost earlier in the battle. If already at full Wounds and another unsaved Wound is inflicted, they gain Regeneration (4+) until the end of the next player turn.`,
    "Crook and Flail of Radiance":`Two hand weapons. The wielder gains Always Strikes First and a +1 Combat Resolution bonus.`,
    "Destroyer of Eternities":`Tomb King on foot only. Great weapon. Attacks have Heroic Killing Blow. The wielder may instead exchange all Attacks for a special attack: all enemy models in base contact suffer a single automatic hit with Heroic Killing Blow. In a challenge, only the models engaged count as being in base contact.`,
    "Phakth's Blades of Justice":`Infantry only. Two hand weapons. The wielder gains +1 Attack for each complete rank any one enemy unit in base contact has.`,
    "Dagger of Bound Souls":`No Magical Ward saves may be taken against Wounds caused by this item. Any model suffering an unsaved Wound must pass a Toughness test or suffer an additional Wound (no saves), repeating until they pass or are slain.`,
    "Blade of Mourning":`If a unit suffers at least one wound from the Blade of Mourning and loses the combat, any negative modifiers to its Leadership for the subsequent Break test are doubled.`,
    "Blade of Setep":`The wielder gains Ignores Armour Saves. If the enemy model wears magical armour, the first Hit against it is ignored but its magical armour is destroyed for the rest of the battle.`,
    "Blades of Honourable Demise":`Two hand weapons. The wielder gains +1 To Hit in close combat.`,
    "The Conqueror's Blade":`The wielder gains Killing Blow. When fighting in a challenge, Killing Blow takes effect on a 5+ rather than a 6.`,
    "Staff of Aeons":`Wizard only. If the wielder successfully Hits an enemy unit in close combat, that unit suffers -1 to their armour saves for the rest of the game (not cumulative).`,
    "Serpent Staff":`Wizards only. The wielder gains Poisoned Attacks and may re-roll failed rolls To Wound.`,
    // -- Magic Armour --
    "Scorpion Armour":`Light armour. The wearer can never suffer more than one wound due to combat resolution. If with a unit, up to half the combat-resolution wounds may be allocated to the character, which are ignored save for the first.`,
    "Armour of Eternity":`Infantry or Cavalry only. Light armour. Enemy models must re-roll successful rolls To Wound against the wearer.`,
    "Vambraces of the Sun":`6+ armour save. All enemy models attempting to strike the bearer in close combat suffer -1 To Hit.`,
    "Armour of the Ages":`Light armour. When reduced to their last Wound, the wearer gains a Magical Ward (3+). No effect if the last Wound came from a Multiple Wounds attack.`,
    "Gauntlet of Hraklonesh":`6+ armour save and +1 Strength and Toughness. At the start of each of your turns the bearer must pass a Toughness test or suffer one Wound (no saves).`,
    "Shield of Ptra":`Shield. The bearer gains Parry (6+) even while mounted. On a successful Parry save, all models in base contact suffer -1 To Hit for the rest of the turn (or next turn if they already attacked).`,
    "Warding Splint":`Wizard only. Light armour. The wearer gains a Magical Ward (5+) in close combat. May be taken even though Wizards may not normally wear armour.`,
    "Royal Mantle":`6+ armour save and the Inspiring Presence (6) special rule.`,
    // -- Talismans --
    "Golden Ankhra":`The bearer gains a Magical Ward (4+) and may re-roll 1's when taking Magical Ward saves.`,
    "Amulet of Pha-Stah":`All enemy Talismans, Arcane Items and Enchanted Items have no effect while in base contact with the wearer.`,
    "Golden Eye of Rah-Nutt":`Model on Chariot only. The bearer gains a Magical Ward (3+) against missile attacks.`,
    "Collar of Shapesh":`For each unsaved Wound the bearer suffers (before Multiple Wounds), roll a D6: on a 4+ the Wound is transferred to a friendly model in base contact of your choice (no saves). These Wounds still count for combat resolution.`,
    "Orb of Ptra":`All missile attacks targeting the bearer or any unit they are with suffer -1 To Hit.`,
    "Blue Khepra":`The bearer (but not any unit they are with) is immune to the effects of all enemy spells.`,
    "Brooch of the Great Desert":`One use only. Used against any enemy spell cast against it before dispelling: the bearer and their unit gain Magic Resistance (5) for the rest of the turn.`,
    "Relic of the Desert Sun":`The bearer gains a Magical Ward (6+) and Immunity (Flaming Attacks).`,
    // -- Arcane Items (must start Relic./Charm./Staff.) --
    "Enkhil's Kanopi":`Relic. Bound spell (Level 1, cast on 5+). Aura with range 24": roll a D6 for every 'remains in play' and long-lasting active spell within range; on 2+ it is dispelled, adding D3 power dice to your pool for each spell ended.`,
    "Phazerakt's Kanopi":`Relic. Bound spell (Level 3, cast on 12+). Augment/summoning, range 12": summon 2D6+3 Skeleton Warriors to an existing unit or create a new (default-equipped) unit.`,
    "Staff of Osiris":`Staff. Bound spell (Level 3, cast on 9+). Magic missile, range 24": a single Strength 6 hit with Armour Piercing (1) and Multiple Wounds (D3) that penetrates ranks like a Bolt Thrower.`,
    "Staff of Ravening":`Staff. Bound spell (Level 1, cast on 5+). Magic missile, range 18": 3D6 Strength 2 hits.`,
    "Neferra's Scrolls of Mighty Incantations":`Charm. One use only. Declared before casting: add bonus dice equal to the Wizard's level (still roll at least one power dice). The bonus dice do not count as power dice, but any double (except 1's) on the initial cast counts as a 6 for Ultimate Power.`,
    "Staff of Awakening":`Staff. The wielder may re-roll the amount of Wounds recovered from The Restless Dead.`,
    "Curse-weaver Wand":`Staff. Gives the bearer a +2 casting bonus when casting hex spells.`,
    "Staff of Mastery":`Staff. Gives the bearer a +1 casting bonus when using the Lore of Light.`,
    "Hieratic Jar":`Charm. One use only. Used at the start of any of your Magic phases: the bearer immediately gains +D3 Power dice. Only they may use these extra Power dice.`,
    "Tablet of Tahoth":`Charm. One use only. After rolling the Power dice to cast a spell, add a +D3 casting bonus to the roll.`,
    // -- Enchanted Items --
    "Golden Death Mask of Kharnutt":`The wearer causes Terror. Enemy units within 6" cannot benefit from Inspiring Presence or Hold Your Ground.`,
    "Cloak of the Dunes":`Infantry only. The wearer gains Fly (10). If the bearer moves over an unengaged enemy unit in the Remaining Moves sub-phase, that unit suffers 2D6 Strength 2 hits. May cross several units in a turn but each target only once.`,
    "Amulet of the Serpent":`The bearer and any unit they join gain Poisoned Attacks in close combat.`,
    "Scarab Brooch":`All models using Entombed Beneath the Sands may re-roll failed rolls to enter the battlefield, and may re-roll the scatter and/or artillery dice when emerging within 12" of the bearer.`,
    "Crown of Kings":`Tomb King only. All friendly units within 6" may make March moves despite being Undead.`,
    "Chariot of Fire":`Model on Chariot only. The Chariot causes 2D6 impact hits with Flaming and Magical Attacks.`,
    "Icon of Rulership":`Model on Chariot only. Gives the bearer a +1 Combat Resolution bonus.`,
    "Karitamen's Death Mask":`The bearer gains +1 Leadership and the Cold-blooded special rule.`,
    // -- Magic Standards --
    "Icon of Rakaph":`Tomb Guard or Tomb Herald on foot only. The unit may attempt a Swift Reform at the start of its Movement phase instead of the Remaining Moves sub-phase, then move as normal (including declaring charges).`,
    "Sigil of Centuries":`All enemy units within 6" of this standard are subject to the Always Strikes Last special rule.`,
    "Standard of the Sands":`One use only. Activated at the start of any enemy Movement phase: for the rest of the turn no models within 24" may March, and units attempting to rally suffer -1 Leadership.`,
    "Banner of the Desert Winds":`Infantry only. The unit gains Swiftstride and Vanguard.`,
    "Mirage Standard":`All Hits from missile attacks targeting the bearer's unit must be re-rolled.`,
    "Icon of the Sacred Eye":`The unit (including mounts) may re-roll failed rolls To Hit in the first round of close combat.`,
    "Royal Standard of Settra":`The unit gains Hatred (Characters) and Fear.`,
    "Tapestry of Conquered Lands":`The unit gains a +D3 Combat Resolution bonus (roll each time it is used).`,
    "Banner of the Hidden Dead":`The unit gains the Entombed Beneath the Sands special rule.`,
    "Standard of the Cursing Word":`All enemy units in base contact with the unit must pass a Leadership test or suffer D6 Wounds (Ignores Armour Saves) at the start of each round of close combat.`,
    "Standard of the Undying Legion":`Bound spell (Level 1, cast on 6+). Augment targeting the bearer's unit: if cast, the unit immediately recovers Wounds' worth of models, as The Restless Dead.`,
    // -- Common rulebook items --
    "Giant Blade":`+3 Strength.`,
    "Sword of Bloodshed":`+3 Attacks.`,
    "Sword of Power":`+2 Strength.`,
    "Sword of Strife":`+2 Attacks.`,
    "Sword of Swift Slaying":`Always Strikes First.`,
    "Parrying Blade":`Parry (5+).`,
    "Blade of Sea Gold":`Armour Piercing (3).`,
    "Ogre Blade":`Multiple Wounds (D3).`,
    "Headsman's Axe":`Killing Blow.`,
    "Sword of Striking":`+1 To Hit. Common.`,
    "Sword of Might":`+1 Strength. Common.`,
    "Sword of Battle":`+1 Attack. Common.`,
    "Shrieking Blade":`Fear.`,
    "Berserker Sword":`Frenzy, and can never lose Frenzy.`,
    "Blade of Slicing":`Armour Piercing (2).`,
    "Venom Sword":`Poisoned Attacks.`,
    "Biting Blade":`Armour Piercing (1). Common.`,
    "Burning Blade":`Flaming Attacks. Common.`,
    "Armour of Destiny":`Heavy armour. Magical Ward (4+).`,
    "Armour of Resilience":`Heavy armour. +1 Toughness.`,
    "Armour of Silvered Steel":`Heavy armour. 2+ armour save.`,
    "Armour of Fortune":`Medium armour. Magical Ward (5+).`,
    "Trickster's Helm":`Infantry/Monstrous Infantry/Cavalry only. 6+ save; enemy must re-roll successful To Wound rolls against the wearer.`,
    "Glittering Scales":`Light armour. Enemy suffer -1 To Hit in close combat.`,
    "Seamless Armour":`Medium armour. Ignores negative save modifiers (cannot drop below 5+).`,
    "Alleviating Armour":`Medium armour. Regeneration (6+).`,
    "Gambler's Armour":`Light armour. Magical Ward (6+).`,
    "Bedazzling Helm":`6+ save; enemy must re-roll 6s To Hit against the wearer in close combat.`,
    "Shield of the Warrior True":`Shield. Magical Ward (5+) against missile attacks.`,
    "Dragonhelm":`6+ save and Immunity (Flaming Attacks).`,
    "Enchanted Shield":`Shield. +1 to armour save. Common.`,
    "Charmed Shield":`Shield, one use. The first hit suffered is ignored on a 2+. Common.`,
    "Talisman of Preservation":`Magical Ward (4+).`,
    "Obsidian Lodestone":`The bearer and any unit they join gain Magic Resistance (3).`,
    "Talisman of Endurance":`Magical Ward (5+).`,
    "Dawnstone":`Infantry/Monstrous Infantry/Cavalry only. Re-roll 1's when taking armour saves.`,
    "Obsidian Amulet":`The bearer and any unit they join gain Magic Resistance (2).`,
    "Opal Amulet":`One use. Magical Ward (2+) against the first unsaved wound suffered. Common.`,
    "Talisman of Protection":`Magical Ward (6+). Common.`,
    "Obsidian Trinket":`The bearer and any unit they join gain Magic Resistance (1). Common.`,
    "Seed of Rebirth":`Regeneration (6+). Common.`,
    "Lucky Trinket":`One use. Re-roll a single failed armour or invulnerable save. Common.`,
    "Wand of the Winds":`Staff. Re-roll one D3 when determining the Winds of Magic each Magic phase.`,
    "Destroy Magic Scroll":`Charm, one use. Counter an enemy spell with 6 free dispel dice; on a 4+ the spell is destroyed for the rest of the game.`,
    "Feedback Scroll":`Charm, one use. After an enemy spell resolves, its caster takes 1 Wound (ignores armour) for each casting die that rolled 5+.`,
    "Dispel Scroll":`Charm, one use. Dispel a spell (including remains-in-play) with 6 free dispel dice.`,
    "Scroll of Leaching":`Charm, one use. After an enemy spell resolves, add dispel dice equal to the dice used to cast it.`,
    "Power Familiar":`Relic. +1 Power Dice each of your Magic phases.`,
    "Wand of Jade":`Staff. +6" casting range to your spells (excluding auras).`,
    "Wand of Jet":`Staff. +6" dispel range.`,
    "Channelling Staff":`Staff. Roll one extra dice when attempting to channel power or dispel dice.`,
    "Forbidden Rod":`Staff, one use. +D6 power dice at the start of your Magic phase, but suffer 1 Wound (ignores armour).`,
    "Wand of Onyx":`Staff. +1 casting bonus.`,
    "Sceptre of Stability":`Staff. +1 dispel bonus.`,
    "Arcane Familiar":`Relic. Choose one Signature spell from any of the eight Winds of Magic as an additional spell. Common.`,
    "Earthing Rod":`Staff, one use. On a miscast, do not add the power dice used to the result. Common.`,
    "Power Scroll":`Charm, one use. During one casting attempt, any double (except 1s) counts as a 6 for Ultimate Power. Common.`,
    "Luckstone":`Charm, one use. Re-roll all dice rolled for a casting or dispel attempt. Common.`,
    "Power Stone":`Charm, one use. +D3 dice to a casting attempt. Common.`,
    "Scroll of Shielding":`Charm, one use. A targeted friendly unit gains Magic Resistance (3) against that spell. Common.`,
